WEBVTT

00:07.665 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

01:36.305 --> 01:39.025
ADAPTED FROM <i>THE EARLY SPRING</i> ON JJWXC.NET
AUTHOR: GU NIANG BIE KU

02:10.584 --> 02:14.105
THE WORKPLACE
ISN'T SOME KIND OF CHILD'S PLAY

02:31.785 --> 02:32.545
Help!

02:41.265 --> 02:42.265
Let me open the door.

02:48.825 --> 02:50.345
Sorry.

02:50.425 --> 02:51.585
It's all my fault.

02:51.665 --> 02:53.385
I was taking a shower
and didn't hear my phone ring.

02:53.985 --> 02:56.625
The landlord told me
a new tenant would be coming tonight.

02:56.705 --> 02:58.705
I forgot to inform Tao

02:58.785 --> 03:00.825
and caused her to mistake you
for some hooligan.

03:00.905 --> 03:01.905
Sorry.

03:01.985 --> 03:03.465
It's my fault.

03:03.545 --> 03:05.345
I should've waited for her to enter
the house before coming up.

03:06.105 --> 03:08.345
Actually, I could feel
that you were scared,

03:08.425 --> 03:09.905
so I didn't enter the lift.

03:09.985 --> 03:11.905
I didn't expect
that I would still scare you.

03:12.505 --> 03:13.905
-Sorry.
-That's not it.

03:13.985 --> 03:15.385
I was way too timid.

03:15.985 --> 03:17.345
I probably scared you too.

03:17.425 --> 03:19.865
I even broke two bottles of your sauce.

03:20.785 --> 03:22.025
It's fine.

03:22.105 --> 03:25.425
Well, I am Sun Yuanzhu.

03:26.505 --> 03:27.505
Sun Yu.

03:28.545 --> 03:29.465
Hello.

03:32.785 --> 03:33.985
Shang Zhitao.

03:34.065 --> 03:34.905
Hello.

03:38.265 --> 03:40.785
It's normal to have a boy
as a flatmate in Beijing.

03:40.865 --> 03:41.825
Don't worry.

03:42.345 --> 03:43.785
I'll interrogate him later.

03:46.985 --> 03:49.105
Wow. You have so many types of seasoning.

03:49.185 --> 03:50.545
You can cook too?

03:50.625 --> 03:51.625
Just simple meals.

03:51.705 --> 03:53.305
I'll make something for you two
if I get the chance.

03:53.385 --> 03:55.705
That's exactly what I'm waiting for.

03:55.785 --> 03:56.905
Do you need any help?

03:57.585 --> 03:58.585
No need.

04:00.585 --> 04:02.345
Do you work at BAT?

04:04.425 --> 04:06.065
Yes. I work in the IT industry.

04:06.665 --> 04:08.665
A rising star in the tech industry.

04:09.425 --> 04:10.745
I work for an online dating company.

04:10.825 --> 04:12.945
-Find me if you need anything.
-Sure.

04:14.225 --> 04:15.065
Tao.

04:15.145 --> 04:17.545
An advertising elite working in Lime.

04:17.624 --> 04:18.504
Lime?

04:18.585 --> 04:20.545
Lime is amazing.
Those who work there are all incredible.

04:20.624 --> 04:21.585
Not at all.

04:21.665 --> 04:24.665
I just got hired. Just a rookie.

04:24.745 --> 04:28.545
When you've survived the initial phase,
you'll be a proven elite.

04:29.145 --> 04:30.465
When I started working,

04:30.545 --> 04:33.385
I spent a whole night at the convenience
store entrance editing my slides.

04:33.465 --> 04:35.265
I was even mistaken for an oden thief.

04:35.345 --> 04:36.825
An oden thief?

04:38.545 --> 04:39.505
What was your name again?

04:41.945 --> 04:42.865
Zhu.

04:43.385 --> 04:44.625
Sun Yuanzhu.

04:44.705 --> 04:46.305
Sun Yuanzhu.

04:46.385 --> 04:47.665
Sorry.

04:48.545 --> 04:49.785
Is your name from the poem

04:50.345 --> 04:51.545
"My lofty aspirations encompass the world.

04:51.625 --> 04:53.185
My wings yearn to carry me
to far-off heights?"

04:55.225 --> 04:56.465
You actually know the poem?

04:56.545 --> 04:58.105
My father taught it to me
when I was young.

04:59.105 --> 05:00.465
That's amazing.

05:00.545 --> 05:01.425
I hereby announce

05:01.505 --> 05:05.345
the completion of our temporary
three-man home.

05:05.425 --> 05:07.985
It's late. Get your things sorted
and go to bed when you're done.

05:08.065 --> 05:09.105
Tomorrow is Saturday.

05:09.185 --> 05:10.025
Let's talk after we wake up.

05:10.105 --> 05:11.385
-Sure.
-Good night.

05:13.865 --> 05:14.705
After you.

05:15.505 --> 05:16.545
After you.

05:17.305 --> 05:18.505
After you.

05:20.105 --> 05:21.865
I'll go in first. Sorry.

05:25.225 --> 05:26.345
After her.

05:45.825 --> 05:46.785
Hello?

05:46.865 --> 05:47.905
<i>Boss.</i>

05:50.265 --> 05:51.625
We lost the Qipai project.

05:51.705 --> 05:54.065
Mr. Lin handed the project to Alex.

05:54.145 --> 05:55.145
What?

05:55.705 --> 05:57.825
<i>Our project has been taken away</i>
<i>by Division Two.</i>

06:00.425 --> 06:01.625
<i>Hello?</i>

06:03.585 --> 06:04.425
Boss, are you listening?

06:05.105 --> 06:06.745
He agreed to the 30% discount
and signed the contract?

06:07.265 --> 06:08.145
<i>I guess.</i>

06:09.945 --> 06:11.145
What an embarrassment.

06:12.945 --> 06:14.145
I've embarrassed you.

06:14.225 --> 06:17.065
I mean, Alex is an embarrassment to Lime.

06:17.145 --> 06:18.145
<i>Exactly.</i>

06:18.225 --> 06:20.905
You've spent years
maintaining Qipai as a client.

06:20.985 --> 06:23.425
<i>We made the proposal</i>
<i>after staying up late for half a month.</i>

06:23.945 --> 06:25.825
<i>Now, the project has been</i>
<i>taken away from our hands.</i>

06:26.505 --> 06:28.505
Boss. What should we do now?

06:29.105 --> 06:31.065
<i>If we can't complete this month's KPI,</i>

06:31.145 --> 06:32.065
-<i>we will--</i>
-Look.

06:32.665 --> 06:34.985
Go and accept
the Mulanshuo e-commerce project.

06:35.065 --> 06:36.465
<i>Didn't you say to reject it?</i>

06:37.385 --> 06:39.585
That company has all kinds of issues.

06:39.665 --> 06:41.145
They are even requesting
a specific production team.

06:41.945 --> 06:42.985
Great.

06:43.065 --> 06:44.825
I hope you have other alternatives.

06:54.585 --> 06:56.505
Which production team
has the client requested?

06:56.585 --> 06:59.105
Laiyu, a production team in Guangzhou.

06:59.185 --> 07:00.225
They have a new energy vehicle commercial

07:00.305 --> 07:02.065
that went viral in the first half
of the year.

07:02.145 --> 07:04.505
They are quite popular among the southern
media outlets. They are not bad.

07:05.025 --> 07:06.465
-Have you contacted them?
-I have.

07:06.545 --> 07:07.705
They are very interested
in working with us,

07:07.785 --> 07:09.745
but their whole team
is based in Guangzhou.

07:10.705 --> 07:12.025
Give me the team's profile.

07:12.105 --> 07:13.185
-Sure.
-I'll leave the rest to you.

07:13.265 --> 07:14.105
Sure.

07:14.185 --> 07:15.025
Boss.

07:15.865 --> 07:18.145
All the other employees are working
on other projects.

07:18.225 --> 07:21.465
Can I bring Shang Zhitao along
for this project?

07:22.105 --> 07:23.945
She is patient and has a good temper.

07:24.025 --> 07:27.425
No one else in Lime
is better than her at this.

07:28.905 --> 07:31.665
Luke. I won't quit.

07:32.465 --> 07:35.185
-Go ahead.
-I also think she'll be helpful.

07:36.145 --> 07:39.545
Helpful? Honest and single-minded.

07:40.265 --> 07:41.945
How long will she last
in the advertising industry?

07:45.425 --> 07:47.985
Didn't you tell me to go ahead?

07:55.385 --> 07:57.465
20,300 YUAN HAS BEEN DEPOSITED

08:04.505 --> 08:06.425
-Mom.
-Tao.

08:08.065 --> 08:09.145
I transferred 16,000 yuan to you.

08:09.225 --> 08:10.385
Did you receive it?

08:11.065 --> 08:12.345
<i>Are you sure it's 16,000 yuan?</i>

08:12.425 --> 08:15.025
<i>Why did I receive 20,300 yuan instead?</i>

08:15.105 --> 08:16.945
Did the bank give me extra?

08:17.025 --> 08:20.425
When I told your dad
to transfer you some money,

08:20.505 --> 08:21.625
he didn't even hesitate.

08:21.705 --> 08:23.625
He would give you a gold mine
if he had one,

08:23.705 --> 08:25.905
let alone the little bit of money
he has now.

08:27.425 --> 08:29.585
Why didn't you give us a call
after you arrived?

08:30.225 --> 08:31.545
<i>How are your food and accommodation?</i>

08:31.625 --> 08:32.465
<i>Do you have enough money?</i>

08:33.144 --> 08:34.305
Which question should I answer first?

08:34.385 --> 08:35.825
‎Well…

08:37.784 --> 08:38.705
Calm down.

08:38.784 --> 08:42.625
<i>You can find a job slowly</i>
<i>until you find the right one.</i>

08:42.705 --> 08:44.225
<i>Don't make do with your job.</i>
<i>If you can't find one, come home.</i>

08:44.305 --> 08:45.505
We'll support you.

08:46.065 --> 08:46.945
Coming home is also a good choice.

08:47.625 --> 08:50.745
Mom. Dad. I love you both so much.

08:50.825 --> 08:52.105
Don't worry, both of you.

08:52.185 --> 08:54.585
Your daughter has been impressive.

08:54.665 --> 08:57.145
I'm now working at the biggest
advertising company in China.

08:57.225 --> 09:00.985
Of course, my daughter is impressive.

09:01.065 --> 09:03.385
<i>You joined a large company in Beijing</i>
<i>as soon as you graduated.</i>

09:03.465 --> 09:05.185
Their revenue reaches billions of yuan.

09:05.265 --> 09:06.105
<i>I'm telling you.</i>

09:06.185 --> 09:10.345
<i>The ancestors of the Shang family</i>
<i>are more than proud of you.</i>

09:11.145 --> 09:13.345
<i>Do you think an ordinary person</i>
<i>is good enough for her?</i>

09:13.425 --> 09:15.505
<i>No. Absolutely not.</i>

09:15.585 --> 09:17.425
I have to go now.
My superior is looking for me.

09:18.745 --> 09:20.145
Don't be too exhausted from working.

09:20.665 --> 09:22.545
If your superior dares to bully you,

09:22.625 --> 09:25.105
<i>your mother and I will fly over</i>
<i>to protect you with sticks in our hands.</i>

09:25.185 --> 09:26.825
Got it. I'm hanging up.

09:28.065 --> 09:29.105
You're already--

09:29.665 --> 09:30.505
She hung up.

09:32.585 --> 09:34.665
<i>Tao, pack up.</i>

09:34.745 --> 09:36.825
<i>We are going on a business trip.</i>
<i>We leave tomorrow morning.</i>

09:37.705 --> 09:38.745
Okay.

09:42.665 --> 09:43.785
Come in.

09:48.745 --> 09:50.385
Came to the office on a weekend?

09:50.465 --> 09:51.585
It's rare for you to do that.

09:52.305 --> 09:55.425
Alex's group stole your client, Qipai.

09:55.505 --> 09:57.185
They're having
a celebration dinner tonight.

09:57.265 --> 09:58.545
They asked me to come over and arrange it.

09:59.305 --> 10:01.625
They sell ideas
as if they were street vendors.

10:01.705 --> 10:04.305
I suggest you send their group
to the market.

10:05.705 --> 10:07.385
It's not a bad idea.

10:07.985 --> 10:09.465
I'll try to contact the market later.

10:10.905 --> 10:12.625
Speaking of which,

10:12.705 --> 10:13.985
in three months,

10:14.505 --> 10:16.785
the company will appoint
one of you two directors

10:16.865 --> 10:18.305
as the acting general manager.

10:19.185 --> 10:21.945
Sales KPI is the most important
assessment criterion.

10:22.025 --> 10:25.345
I think he probably has heard
something about it.

10:25.865 --> 10:27.385
Otherwise, he wouldn't have

10:27.465 --> 10:29.145
dared to slash his price
to steal your client.

10:30.065 --> 10:31.345
I wish him success, then.

10:37.345 --> 10:38.265
Look at this.

10:41.585 --> 10:42.425
MULANSHUO E-COMMERCE TVC PROPOSAL
BUSINESS DIVISION ONE

10:42.505 --> 10:43.905
Mulanshuo?

10:45.225 --> 10:46.865
No wonder you are so calm.

10:47.745 --> 10:49.585
Turns out, you've taken
the Mulanshuo project.

10:49.665 --> 10:53.865
However, their budget
is 20% higher than Qipai's.

10:53.945 --> 10:55.665
This is a huge project.

10:56.425 --> 10:57.465
I'm sure Lumi will be very busy.

10:58.185 --> 11:00.825
Oh, is she getting Shang Zhitao
involved in the project as well?

11:00.905 --> 11:02.225
If you really care about her,

11:02.745 --> 11:04.225
spare her some manpower.

11:04.305 --> 11:05.545
It's urgent, and the workload is heavy.

11:05.625 --> 11:07.265
A rookie won't be much help.

11:07.345 --> 11:08.745
Got it.

11:08.825 --> 11:10.825
When you're shooting the commercial,
I'll assign some people to help you.

11:13.625 --> 11:15.585
Fine. I won't disturb you any longer.

11:15.665 --> 11:17.705
I'll go contact the supermarket now.

11:19.345 --> 11:20.265
I'm leaving.

11:24.985 --> 11:25.905
1.2 CORE COMPETITIVENESS

11:25.985 --> 11:27.465
2.1 MAIN CREATIVE TEAM
DIRECTOR: LI WENCAI

11:27.545 --> 11:28.985
MAIN OUTDOOR PHOTOGRAPHY: PAN WEIHAO

11:40.065 --> 11:41.265
Hello?

11:41.785 --> 11:43.545
What time is your flight tomorrow?

11:45.265 --> 11:46.505
Help me book a ticket.

12:04.825 --> 12:05.745
Flora.

12:06.265 --> 12:07.505
You're so early.

12:08.145 --> 12:09.985
-Are you studying?
-I'm just reading.

12:10.665 --> 12:12.025
Luke, good morning.

12:12.745 --> 12:13.585
Morning.

12:14.905 --> 12:15.865
Do you want coffee?

12:15.945 --> 12:17.385
-I'm going to buy coffee.
-Let me pay for it.

12:17.465 --> 12:18.505
No need.

12:19.745 --> 12:22.705
Don't try to use any street smarts.
It doesn't suit you.

12:33.905 --> 12:36.905
This boss of mine is handsome,

12:37.625 --> 12:38.985
but he has a foul mouth.

12:44.425 --> 12:47.385
GUANGZHOU

12:49.985 --> 12:51.665
This is already the fourth brew.

12:51.745 --> 12:53.665
-I'm going to order some liquor.
-Thank you.

12:53.745 --> 12:55.425
What's the meaning of this?

12:55.505 --> 12:57.665
They said they were already
on the way an hour ago.

12:57.745 --> 12:58.825
Fooling around with me?

12:59.665 --> 13:00.665
Calm down.

13:01.305 --> 13:02.905
Calm down, you say?

13:15.985 --> 13:16.945
Mr. Li.

13:17.705 --> 13:18.545
It's been a while.

13:19.385 --> 13:20.305
I didn't expect

13:21.745 --> 13:23.105
you to come in person.

13:24.865 --> 13:27.105
When I saw your name,
I wanted to pay you a visit.

13:30.505 --> 13:31.865
Do you two know each other?

13:31.945 --> 13:32.785
We do.

13:32.865 --> 13:36.505
Luke is our team's benefactor.

13:37.505 --> 13:38.785
Mr. Li, you flatter me.

13:38.865 --> 13:40.265
Don't be so humble.

13:40.865 --> 13:41.705
Four years ago,

13:41.785 --> 13:43.905
if you hadn't kicked us
out of the project,

13:43.985 --> 13:46.505
our team wouldn't have achieved
so many things now.

13:47.145 --> 13:48.945
Don't bully a young person for being poor,

13:49.025 --> 13:50.665
for he might turn into a dragon one day.

13:51.305 --> 13:53.105
Don't believe it,
and you'll be poor forever.

13:53.785 --> 13:56.865
This has been our team's motto
for all these years.

13:56.945 --> 14:00.745
I can't believe
I get to say it to you today.

14:03.985 --> 14:05.425
I didn't look down on your team back then.

14:05.505 --> 14:08.345
It's only a given for you
to achieve great things today.

14:09.265 --> 14:10.585
Even if I could turn back time,

14:10.665 --> 14:12.905
after much deliberation,

14:12.985 --> 14:14.545
your team still wouldn't necessarily
be the best choice.

14:16.025 --> 14:17.225
I completely understand.

14:17.305 --> 14:21.345
So, our team also did much deliberation
regarding your project today.

14:22.025 --> 14:23.985
The project is not bad,
and the budget is high.

14:24.065 --> 14:26.385
However, our team can't fit
this project into our schedule.

14:27.745 --> 14:30.905
Please find another team
for the commercial shoot.

14:34.665 --> 14:35.625
Mr. Li,

14:35.705 --> 14:37.705
you could've told us a day earlier
that you were booked.

14:37.785 --> 14:39.825
We wouldn't have had
to fly all the way here

14:40.505 --> 14:41.385
just to eat pork buns.

14:42.985 --> 14:44.065
Consider it my treat.

14:48.145 --> 14:49.025
Mr. Li,

14:49.745 --> 14:50.625
if you change your mind,

14:51.345 --> 14:54.465
let us know your conditions,
thoughts, and requirements up front.

14:54.985 --> 14:56.105
We'll do our best to work with your team.

14:56.625 --> 14:59.585
We purposely flew here
for a collaboration.

14:59.665 --> 15:02.145
If you are free, you may let us know.

15:02.905 --> 15:04.985
We'll have a chance to work together
in the future.

15:12.265 --> 15:13.665
Should we go after him?

15:13.745 --> 15:14.665
Go after him?

15:16.065 --> 15:16.945
Just wait.

15:22.505 --> 15:23.705
Luke.

15:23.785 --> 15:25.705
Should we find another team as a backup?

15:29.265 --> 15:31.585
A supply-and-demand relationship
decides our bargaining chip.

15:32.985 --> 15:36.185
Lumi, help me look for the director
they usually work with

15:36.265 --> 15:37.465
and the brands
they've recently worked with.

15:38.265 --> 15:39.705
Got it.

15:45.985 --> 15:49.705
He brought us here just to gloat at Luke?

15:49.785 --> 15:51.665
Let's do as Luke told us to for now.

15:51.745 --> 15:52.985
I was wondering

15:53.065 --> 15:54.585
why he insisted on coming
when the attendant

15:54.665 --> 15:56.105
does not share the same title as his.

15:56.185 --> 15:57.265
Now, I know why.

15:57.345 --> 15:58.985
He must have guessed this would happen.

15:59.065 --> 16:01.145
With him around, he must have a plan.

16:01.225 --> 16:02.905
-Can he deal with this?
-Yes.

16:04.225 --> 16:05.705
Do you trust him so much?

16:05.785 --> 16:06.865
Of course.

16:06.945 --> 16:08.985
When it comes to work,
he has always been reliable.

16:14.385 --> 16:15.225
Sure.

16:15.745 --> 16:18.305
Please send the relevant information
to my inbox.

16:21.745 --> 16:22.585
Thank you.

16:24.585 --> 16:26.465
LAIYU'S INFORMATION
FREQUENT COLLABORATORS OF THE CAMERA TEAM

16:26.545 --> 16:27.625
TIAN ZHENG

16:27.705 --> 16:30.065
OVERVIEW

16:32.345 --> 16:33.705
WANT TO BECOME AN EXTRA?

16:33.785 --> 16:35.225
DIRECTOR TIAN ZHENG IS SHOOTING
A COMMERCIAL. JOIN NOW!

16:35.305 --> 16:36.145
REQUIREMENTS FOR EXTRAS

16:36.225 --> 16:37.105
EXTRA CALL FOR COMMERCIAL SHOOT
REPORT TO SET IMMEDIATELY

16:37.185 --> 16:38.105
LOCATION: STUDIO 1 AT GUANGZHOU YINGXIANG

16:42.505 --> 16:43.505
ENTER

16:47.625 --> 16:49.985
Laiyu is indeed an excellent team
on the rise.

16:50.065 --> 16:53.425
They've worked on 70%
of all popular brands' commercial shoots.

16:53.505 --> 16:54.985
All new production teams
will experience a bottleneck.

16:55.505 --> 16:56.945
Have they done any international
tier-one brands' commercials?

16:57.905 --> 16:59.065
No.

17:00.385 --> 17:01.825
Give me a list

17:01.905 --> 17:03.585
of all international clients
of Lime in Guangzhou.

17:05.025 --> 17:06.464
-Swapping resources.
-Yes.

17:08.345 --> 17:09.905
What about Taobao?

17:09.985 --> 17:12.025
There's also a new automobile brand
from Germany.

17:13.345 --> 17:15.665
Not long ago, they tried to secure
a partnership with Tmall, but they failed.

17:17.224 --> 17:18.184
Look.

17:18.265 --> 17:19.825
Go and focus on getting
the Taobao project.

17:20.585 --> 17:21.545
All right.

17:25.464 --> 17:26.545
Where's Shang Zhitao?

17:39.865 --> 17:41.785
What are you doing?
We are going to brief the extras.

17:41.865 --> 17:43.665
Why are you running around?
Get back immediately.

17:45.865 --> 17:46.825
Sure.

17:55.225 --> 17:56.545
I think for the scene just now…

17:57.145 --> 17:58.025
‎I've said it before…

18:18.465 --> 18:20.105
LUMI

18:22.425 --> 18:23.785
<i>Flora, where are you?</i>

18:23.865 --> 18:24.905
Lumi.

18:24.985 --> 18:27.185
I… I'm at Laiyu's filming set.

18:27.985 --> 18:29.185
Filming set?

18:30.465 --> 18:32.025
<i>I'm here as an extra.</i>

18:32.705 --> 18:34.105
<i>I saw the director just now.</i>

18:34.185 --> 18:37.065
I wanted to see
if I could get something out of him.

18:37.145 --> 18:39.305
Use this opportunity to ask the director.

18:39.385 --> 18:41.705
Tell him you have a Taobao project
to work on.

18:41.785 --> 18:42.905
<i>Ask him if he's interested.</i>

18:42.985 --> 18:45.105
I…

18:45.185 --> 18:46.185
Can I ask him directly?

18:46.265 --> 18:47.385
Ask him directly.

18:47.465 --> 18:48.345
I'll take full responsibility
if something happens.

18:48.425 --> 18:49.385
No one will blame you.

18:51.345 --> 18:52.465
All right.

18:58.625 --> 18:59.905
It was an exciting performance.

19:00.785 --> 19:03.545
I'll call everyone here at lunchtime

19:03.625 --> 19:06.665
to talk about
our filming plan in the future.

19:07.185 --> 19:09.585
For the next scene…

19:09.665 --> 19:10.665
Director,

19:11.265 --> 19:13.105
I am Shang Zhitao from Lime Advertising.

19:13.865 --> 19:14.745
Hello.

19:17.345 --> 19:18.825
Not bad.

19:18.905 --> 19:20.145
I didn't expect you to be so smart.

19:21.225 --> 19:23.505
I thought I couldn't help much.

19:23.585 --> 19:25.825
Since Luke wanted to know
more about the director,

19:25.905 --> 19:27.945
I rushed to the set to take a look.

19:32.465 --> 19:33.385
Lumi.

19:33.465 --> 19:35.665
Why aren't both of them speaking
to each other?

19:36.345 --> 19:38.305
It's fine. He knows what to do.

19:41.305 --> 19:43.065
You went over my head

19:43.705 --> 19:44.785
and spoke to the director immediately.

19:45.705 --> 19:46.985
Impressive.

19:47.065 --> 19:49.465
Do you think I can't deal with your trick?

19:50.665 --> 19:51.705
Mr. Li,

19:51.785 --> 19:54.785
in business,
we always have to look forward.

19:54.865 --> 19:56.665
If this project is a success,

19:57.345 --> 19:58.785
and the filming of the commercial
is completed,

20:00.545 --> 20:03.945
your team will truly be the best
commercial production team in Guangzhou.

20:04.025 --> 20:06.465
However, if you're stuck in the past

20:07.385 --> 20:08.745
and give up on a top-tier client,

20:09.545 --> 20:10.465
it won't be worth it.

20:17.985 --> 20:21.225
I'm betting that within ten seconds,

20:21.305 --> 20:23.585
Mr. Li will give in.

20:29.825 --> 20:31.985
Taobao's annual project…

20:36.065 --> 20:37.305
I'll do my best.

20:37.945 --> 20:40.825
Then, let's wipe the slate clean
regarding what happened before.

20:41.865 --> 20:43.865
-To a successful partnership.
-To a successful partnership.

20:52.225 --> 20:53.465
See?

20:53.545 --> 20:56.385
This is his charm,
despite being so stubborn.

20:58.065 --> 20:59.785
Why is he so amazing?

21:01.145 --> 21:03.105
One, he's vicious.

21:03.825 --> 21:05.785
He's vicious to himself,
and he's even more vicious to the clients.

21:06.385 --> 21:08.305
Two, he's wise.

21:08.385 --> 21:11.065
He knows when to advance
and when to take a step back.

21:11.145 --> 21:13.225
Three, he's cold.

21:13.305 --> 21:14.545
No one knows what he is thinking.

21:14.625 --> 21:16.505
That makes them want to win him over.

21:16.585 --> 21:17.665
Isn't that crazy?

21:20.065 --> 21:21.425
He sounds like

21:22.745 --> 21:23.985
a villain.

21:24.065 --> 21:26.905
There's no hero or villain
in the workplace.

21:27.585 --> 21:29.305
Only winners and losers.

21:29.385 --> 21:31.385
Luan Nian is the winner.

21:32.305 --> 21:34.945
If you want to learn things,
you need to work under him.

21:35.825 --> 21:37.665
I can also learn a lot from you.

21:37.745 --> 21:39.505
If I learn from him,

21:40.345 --> 21:42.665
I… He won't think I'm good enough.

21:44.825 --> 21:48.665
No one in Lime is good enough for him.

21:50.065 --> 21:52.065
Join us for dinner tonight.

21:52.665 --> 21:54.185
Don't wear this outfit.

21:54.265 --> 21:55.825
I have a nice dress for you.

21:59.825 --> 22:05.225
Today, I must thank Luke
for all his efforts.

22:05.985 --> 22:07.065
That's too much praise, Mr. Li.

22:07.585 --> 22:09.945
I must thank Laiyu.

22:10.025 --> 22:11.905
Your ad quality is excellent.

22:11.985 --> 22:13.465
The client is also showing gratitude

22:13.545 --> 22:15.505
and hoping for long-term collaboration
among us.

22:16.425 --> 22:17.345
Everyone, let's have a toast!

22:17.425 --> 22:18.825
-Together!
-Cheers.

22:24.465 --> 22:27.145
Shang Zhitao.

22:27.225 --> 22:28.265
Did I remember your name right?

22:28.345 --> 22:29.225
Yes, Mr. Li.

22:30.905 --> 22:32.425
Come, Ms. Shang.

22:32.505 --> 22:35.625
It's all thanks to you for making
this partnership a success.

22:35.705 --> 22:37.105
Come. A toast to you.

22:38.865 --> 22:41.665
Mr. Li, I… I don't really drink.

22:42.585 --> 22:46.265
How can you not drink
when you're in the advertising business?

22:46.345 --> 22:49.505
Besides, you either drink or you don't.

22:49.585 --> 22:50.505
Not knowing how to drink is nonsense.

22:52.585 --> 22:53.705
Cheers.

22:57.945 --> 23:00.305
Ms. Shang, you're indeed
an exceptional woman.

23:00.945 --> 23:02.145
Where are you from?

23:02.665 --> 23:05.305
I'm from Harbin.

23:05.385 --> 23:08.745
Women from the Northeast
are all attractive.

23:09.345 --> 23:12.225
You also carry the grace
of a woman from the South.

23:12.305 --> 23:13.185
Are you single?

23:16.225 --> 23:18.505
Mr. Li, where do you think I'm from?

23:18.585 --> 23:19.825
You…

23:20.345 --> 23:21.785
I'm from Beijing.

23:21.865 --> 23:24.545
Let me offer you a toast on behalf
of the capital's people. Cheers.

23:24.625 --> 23:26.465
-You are--
-Let me do it.

23:28.585 --> 23:30.905
Flora, you still need to write
that report later.

23:30.985 --> 23:31.825
Make sure you're sober.

23:31.905 --> 23:34.945
If you submit it late,
Mr. Luan will chew you out.

23:35.665 --> 23:38.665
That's right, Mr. Li.
I still need to write a report later.

23:39.905 --> 23:44.105
Does Lime allow you
to leave dinner early now?

23:44.745 --> 23:46.905
-Come.
-You can't leave, Flora.

23:48.905 --> 23:49.985
Go and listen to the conference call.

23:50.065 --> 23:51.505
It'll help with your report.

23:53.265 --> 23:54.105
All right.

23:55.585 --> 23:57.985
Don't answer any calls
or reply to any texts.

24:04.105 --> 24:06.185
-Let me fill your glass.
-Sure. Thanks.

24:06.265 --> 24:08.785
-Director, a toast to you.
-Sure.

24:11.985 --> 24:14.425
You are quite protective of women now.

24:17.465 --> 24:20.385
Taking good care of female employees
is the duty of every Lime employee.

24:34.305 --> 24:36.345
ARE YOU STILL ANGRY AT ME?

24:43.385 --> 24:44.865
LUAN NIAN, I WAS WRONG
I CAN'T LET YOU GO

24:54.505 --> 24:55.545
Luke.

24:56.985 --> 24:58.825
Where are Lumi and the rest?

24:58.905 --> 25:00.025
They are sending Mr. Li and the rest back.

25:14.025 --> 25:15.665
CLEAR

25:19.185 --> 25:20.385
Luke.

25:20.465 --> 25:22.625
Thank you for saving me
from all that drinking today.

25:23.145 --> 25:25.945
I've learned a lot on this business trip.

25:27.705 --> 25:30.225
If you can't drink, don't even take a sip.

25:30.305 --> 25:32.225
Not everyone deserves a toast.

25:34.225 --> 25:35.065
All right.

25:38.825 --> 25:40.105
Let me get us a ride.

25:40.185 --> 25:42.985
We'll walk back
to get rid of the smell of alcohol.

26:35.105 --> 26:35.985
No need.

26:38.345 --> 26:39.305
Put it on.

26:40.065 --> 26:40.905
I feel warm.

26:49.785 --> 26:50.785
Thank you, Luke.

26:57.065 --> 26:57.905
Flora.

26:59.065 --> 27:00.985
If a client asks whether you're single
or not next time,

27:01.585 --> 27:02.865
how will you answer?

27:03.865 --> 27:06.105
I'll just be honest and say I'm single.

27:07.585 --> 27:10.225
Are you trying to tell him
that he has a chance?

27:16.065 --> 27:18.665
Luke, are you single?

27:20.105 --> 27:21.265
Yes.

27:21.345 --> 27:24.065
Are you also telling me
that I have a chance?

27:28.425 --> 27:30.105
If you're drunk, go back and sleep.

27:30.705 --> 27:31.745
You'll find what you want in your dream.

28:05.665 --> 28:07.225
Luan Nian!

28:08.825 --> 28:09.745
Zang Yao?

28:17.665 --> 28:19.025
Are you surprised?

28:19.105 --> 28:20.505
Why are you here?

28:20.585 --> 28:22.585
What? Am I not welcome here?

28:22.665 --> 28:23.665
No.

28:24.185 --> 28:25.625
I mean, how do you know I'm here?

28:26.745 --> 28:28.145
Seriously.

28:28.225 --> 28:29.185
If Chen Kuannian hadn't told me

28:29.265 --> 28:30.345
that you were in Guangzhou
on a business trip,

28:30.425 --> 28:31.505
I wouldn't have known.

28:31.585 --> 28:33.505
It's an urgent business trip.

28:33.585 --> 28:35.385
I'm in a rush and will go back tomorrow.

28:36.025 --> 28:38.425
I'm going out to drink with Chen.
Join us for another round.

28:38.505 --> 28:39.745
Let's go.

28:39.825 --> 28:40.705
I'm not going.

28:40.785 --> 28:42.185
I still have important work to do.

28:43.025 --> 28:44.825
Don't drive if you drink.

28:45.345 --> 28:47.625
Ask Chen or your boyfriend
to drive you back.

28:48.145 --> 28:49.865
What a party pooper.

28:50.665 --> 28:51.745
We already broke up.

28:53.025 --> 28:54.345
Again?

28:54.985 --> 28:56.665
What? I'm just learning from you.

28:56.745 --> 28:58.425
Of all things, why learn that from me?

28:59.385 --> 29:00.225
Why did you break up?

29:01.145 --> 29:04.425
Why are you acting like my dad?
You ask too many questions.

29:05.145 --> 29:06.665
Enough. Just go back to work.

29:06.745 --> 29:09.745
I'm telling you.
I'm going to Beijing next month.

29:09.825 --> 29:11.825
You must find time to accompany me,
no matter what.

29:11.905 --> 29:12.825
All right?

29:12.905 --> 29:13.945
Why are you going back to Beijing?

29:14.025 --> 29:15.545
What? Am I not welcome there?

29:16.665 --> 29:17.825
Of course, you are.

29:17.905 --> 29:19.425
I'll treat you to dinner when you're back.

29:20.145 --> 29:24.705
<i>You two were walking</i>
<i>along the Pearl River late at night.</i>

29:24.785 --> 29:27.145
Tao, I think something might happen

29:27.865 --> 29:29.385
between you and your boss.

29:29.465 --> 29:31.065
What?

29:31.145 --> 29:32.505
<i>Didn't you say</i>

29:32.585 --> 29:34.865
he helped you deflect drinks
and got you out of a tight spot

29:34.945 --> 29:36.665
and gave you his jacket?

29:38.945 --> 29:40.865
That's because he is a gentleman.

29:41.465 --> 29:42.625
Is Luan Nian handsome?

29:45.905 --> 29:48.465
<i>The kind of roguishly handsome type.</i>

29:48.545 --> 29:50.665
<i>Moreover, he has many women around him.</i>

29:51.665 --> 29:52.745
<i>You're right.</i>

29:52.825 --> 29:58.305
A high-quality elite bachelor
will be surrounded by women.

29:58.385 --> 29:59.905
But don't give up.

30:00.425 --> 30:01.265
You aren't bad.

30:01.865 --> 30:04.265
<i>You have a nice body, and you're pretty.</i>

30:04.345 --> 30:05.345
That's enough, Sun Yu.

30:05.945 --> 30:06.985
I still have a report to rush.

30:07.065 --> 30:08.185
I'll talk to you later.

30:12.905 --> 30:14.185
LUAN NIAN
ARE YOU NOT GOING TO RETURN MY JACKET?

30:19.145 --> 30:20.305
WHICH ROOM ARE YOU IN?

30:31.225 --> 30:32.385
Luke.

30:32.465 --> 30:34.305
Sorry for disturbing you so late at night.

30:34.385 --> 30:35.905
Thank you for lending me your jacket.

30:36.585 --> 30:38.505
-Come in.
-No.

30:38.585 --> 30:40.305
I shouldn't enter your room.

30:40.825 --> 30:43.345
If someone sees us so late at night,
it will be hard to explain.

30:43.425 --> 30:44.425
It'll damage your reputation.

30:45.425 --> 30:46.305
Are you from the past or what?

30:56.465 --> 30:58.025
Give this to Lumi tomorrow morning.

31:09.265 --> 31:10.825
What are you thinking?

31:12.625 --> 31:13.545
I…

31:14.865 --> 31:16.425
I think

31:17.065 --> 31:19.225
it might be inconvenient
if someone is in your room.

31:28.665 --> 31:32.985
Am I some sort of pervert in your mind?

31:33.745 --> 31:35.145
No.

31:43.305 --> 31:44.425
If you have time to do that,

31:45.025 --> 31:47.025
you should reflect on your work again.

31:47.105 --> 31:48.225
In the workplace,
only results can speak for you.

31:48.745 --> 31:51.905
Go back and think about how to improve.

31:51.985 --> 31:52.865
Go back.

31:55.345 --> 31:58.505
I'll go back and reflect on my work
and send it to you. Please guide me.

31:59.385 --> 32:00.665
Why are you sending it to me?

32:01.465 --> 32:02.545
Am I your mentor or what?

32:05.505 --> 32:06.665
You're still not leaving?

32:23.905 --> 32:24.825
It's done, sir.

32:25.345 --> 32:26.545
-Thank you.
-Boss.

32:26.625 --> 32:27.665
Here you go.

32:32.105 --> 32:33.265
-Is it done?
-Yes.

32:34.465 --> 32:35.345
Is it done?

32:37.105 --> 32:38.745
-Thank you.
-You're welcome.

32:38.825 --> 32:40.225
We got the deal,

32:40.305 --> 32:43.225
but we're in trouble again
when coming up with a proposal later.

32:43.745 --> 32:47.225
Lumi, can I become the assistant
to the PM for this project?

32:48.225 --> 32:50.545
Sure. If you think you can handle it,
just go for it.

32:56.945 --> 32:57.945
I'm back.

32:58.025 --> 32:59.505
Tao, you're back.

32:59.585 --> 33:01.065
Just in time.

33:01.145 --> 33:02.185
Lei,

33:02.705 --> 33:04.585
I've not seen Shang Zhitao
come back for dinner

33:04.665 --> 33:07.545
for a long time.

33:07.625 --> 33:09.145
Shang Zhitao?

33:09.225 --> 33:10.345
-Hello.
-Lei.

33:10.425 --> 33:11.625
-I'm Zhang Lei.
-Hello, Lei.

33:11.705 --> 33:13.425
I've finally met our landlord.

33:15.545 --> 33:17.825
-Wow, what a feast.
-Sit down, quickly.

33:18.545 --> 33:20.465
I didn't help out at all today.

33:20.545 --> 33:21.865
Let me do the dishes, all right?

33:22.385 --> 33:23.625
How much should I pay?
Who should I transfer to?

33:24.225 --> 33:26.065
No need. Let Lei and me treat everyone.

33:26.145 --> 33:27.905
We must take care of each other
when we're living outside.

33:28.745 --> 33:31.065
Most importantly, it doesn't cost much.

33:31.145 --> 33:34.465
Let's have a toast first
to celebrate our landlord's return.

33:34.545 --> 33:36.425
-Welcome!
-Welcome!

33:36.505 --> 33:37.585
Thank you, everyone.

33:39.585 --> 33:41.945
Lei, you've been working
abroad for two months.

33:42.025 --> 33:42.905
Right?

33:42.985 --> 33:44.585
The project was running for too long.

33:45.545 --> 33:46.585
I've not come home for two months.

33:46.665 --> 33:47.745
-Thanks, babe.
-I'm so exhausted.

33:48.985 --> 33:51.425
But I can see that you three
are getting along well. Thank you.

33:51.505 --> 33:54.265
Of course. These two people are nice.

33:54.345 --> 33:57.225
They are the stars in the sky

33:57.305 --> 33:58.865
compared to those two who only
deserve to live in the basement.

33:58.945 --> 33:59.785
Really?

33:59.865 --> 34:02.545
Shang Zhitao, it's our first meeting.

34:03.145 --> 34:05.225
I didn't prepare any gift for you.

34:05.305 --> 34:08.985
Well, I'll give you
a discount of 100 yuan on your rent.

34:09.065 --> 34:09.905
Really?

34:11.264 --> 34:12.465
You didn't give me the same favor.

34:13.824 --> 34:15.304
You took care of the house well.

34:15.824 --> 34:16.705
I'll give you a 50-yuan discount.

34:17.705 --> 34:18.545
Not bad.

34:22.744 --> 34:23.625
Everyone will get a 100-yuan discount!

34:24.585 --> 34:25.465
Thank you, Lei.

34:25.545 --> 34:27.585
-Thank you, Landlord.
-Thank you!

34:28.105 --> 34:29.105
Cheers!

34:31.304 --> 34:32.905
Hurry and eat.

34:32.985 --> 34:34.625
Lei. Thank you.

34:34.705 --> 34:35.945
You can hold your liquor.

34:36.025 --> 34:36.865
-Lei.
-Cheers!

34:36.945 --> 34:38.744
-Thanks, Landlord.
-The meat is ready.

34:38.824 --> 34:40.344
Do you still want that discount?

34:48.585 --> 34:49.744
<i>Flora,</i>

34:49.824 --> 34:52.264
<i>have you reminded Luke</i>
<i>to approve the business trip expenses?</i>

34:52.344 --> 34:53.865
Why hasn't it been approved yet?

34:53.945 --> 34:55.185
I'm going to make a claim on Monday.

34:55.264 --> 34:57.505
I sent it to him,
but he didn't give me a reply.

34:57.585 --> 34:58.745
<i>Rush him again.</i>

34:58.825 --> 35:01.065
Otherwise, just call him.

35:03.185 --> 35:04.545
Sure.

35:05.385 --> 35:06.505
Don't be scared.

35:06.585 --> 35:08.585
Rushing your boss
will help you gain experience.

35:08.665 --> 35:09.545
I'm counting on you.

35:09.625 --> 35:10.465
<i>Bye.</i>

35:31.585 --> 35:32.465
<i>Hello, Luke.</i>

35:32.545 --> 35:34.065
<i>Sorry for disturbing you this late.</i>

35:34.145 --> 35:36.425
<i>I have a few things to confirm with you.</i>

35:36.505 --> 35:39.025
<i>Also, I need you to approve an OA budget.</i>

35:41.585 --> 35:43.225
<i>What's the rush for payment?</i>

35:43.305 --> 35:45.825
<i>Even if I approve it at night,</i>
<i>will the finance department pay you?</i>

35:54.945 --> 35:56.385
RE: BUDGET APPROVAL - FUND REQUEST
PAYMENT APPROVED

35:56.465 --> 35:57.865
SEND

35:59.025 --> 36:00.345
LUKE: PAYMENT APPROVED

36:05.545 --> 36:06.545
<i>Thank you.</i>

36:06.625 --> 36:08.585
<i>I've learned a lot.</i>
<i>Thank you for the hard work.</i>

36:10.225 --> 36:12.745
I'll go back and reflect on my work
and send it to you.

36:12.825 --> 36:13.985
Please guide me.

36:20.105 --> 36:21.265
<i>Do you need anything else from me?</i>

36:26.025 --> 36:27.865
<i>There's more, but it's not urgent.</i>

36:27.945 --> 36:29.105
<i>It's late.</i>

36:29.185 --> 36:30.745
<i>I won't disturb your rest any further.</i>

36:33.225 --> 36:34.065
SHANG ZHITAO

36:38.065 --> 36:39.465
LUAN NIAN

36:42.025 --> 36:43.185
Luke.

36:43.785 --> 36:45.225
Are you going
to disturb me tomorrow, then?

36:47.345 --> 36:48.945
I left some documents at the office.

36:49.025 --> 36:50.105
I'm afraid you might not see them.

36:50.185 --> 36:51.545
<i>I'm at the office now.</i>

36:51.625 --> 36:54.105
What else do you need me for?
Tell me everything in one go.

36:55.305 --> 36:56.785
Also,

36:56.865 --> 36:59.385
the filming venue needs your approval.

36:59.465 --> 37:00.825
<i>I sent it to your secretary.</i>

37:00.905 --> 37:02.505
I'll confirm with the client on Monday.

37:03.385 --> 37:04.425
Also,

37:04.505 --> 37:08.905
I sent the filming material
and budget usage progress to you.

37:08.985 --> 37:10.145
<i>They require your approval.</i>

37:10.665 --> 37:12.025
Go and find Jack tomorrow.

37:14.265 --> 37:17.265
Then, there's nothing else for now.

37:17.345 --> 37:19.425
Sorry for disturbing you.

37:20.945 --> 37:21.785
It's all right.

37:21.865 --> 37:24.065
<i>Thank you for the hard work. Good night.</i>

37:31.945 --> 37:33.545
SHANG ZHITAO

37:38.145 --> 37:39.025
<i>You're still not hanging up?</i>

37:39.105 --> 37:40.185
Are you eavesdropping?

37:40.785 --> 37:42.225
Workplace etiquette.
The boss should hang up first.

37:42.985 --> 37:44.025
Workplace etiquette?

37:46.665 --> 37:47.505
Fine.

37:48.025 --> 37:49.185
I should have hung up sooner.

37:57.105 --> 38:00.345
Patience is probably her strength.

38:06.545 --> 38:08.345
-Are you still working so late at night?
-Yes.

38:08.425 --> 38:10.505
I'm rushing my boss to approve a budget.

38:10.585 --> 38:12.345
-How is it? Are you done?
-Done.

38:12.425 --> 38:13.265
That's great.

38:13.785 --> 38:17.065
In my opinion, being in a workplace
is like being in a relationship.

38:17.145 --> 38:19.025
The boss tortures me thousands of times,

38:19.105 --> 38:21.465
but I still treat him like my first love.

38:24.265 --> 38:26.945
My experience tells me
that first loves don't end well.

38:27.025 --> 38:30.825
You must not have any feelings
toward your boss.

38:31.545 --> 38:32.825
Don't scare her.

38:32.905 --> 38:34.225
A boss isn't God.

38:34.305 --> 38:37.305
He just has a few more years of experience
compared to you.

38:37.385 --> 38:39.345
You work so hard. I'm sure
your efforts will be seen one day.

38:40.425 --> 38:42.465
I'm not as hardworking as my boss.

38:42.545 --> 38:44.785
He is still working overtime
in the office now.

38:44.865 --> 38:46.105
He's talented and hardworking.

38:47.345 --> 38:49.985
Going to work feels like
the college entrance examination for me.

38:50.065 --> 38:51.465
I dare not get a single question wrong.

38:52.505 --> 38:55.145
Working is not like running a marathon.

38:55.745 --> 38:57.505
You don't have to be on the same path
as your boss.

38:57.585 --> 38:59.065
Just be a blade of grass.

38:59.785 --> 39:03.185
Even if he has a temper,
you can still grow on the ground.

39:03.265 --> 39:05.265
Bouncing back after a storm.

39:07.225 --> 39:09.745
A rookie's greatest strength
isn't experience,

39:09.825 --> 39:11.585
but the vigor to grow wildly.

39:12.105 --> 39:15.625
Moss flowers as small as a grain of rice
also bloom like the peony.

39:15.705 --> 39:18.665
You are just like a seed now.

39:19.185 --> 39:21.465
No one can stop you once
you grow out of the ground.

39:22.105 --> 39:24.145
Well said.

39:24.665 --> 39:25.785
I heard it from a scholar…

39:25.865 --> 39:26.865
I mean, I learned it.

39:26.945 --> 39:28.625
Blooming like the roses or something.

39:28.705 --> 39:30.265
-Peony.
-Peony.

39:30.345 --> 39:33.065
I'm telling you. Hiring people
isn't like opening a mystery box.

39:33.145 --> 39:35.025
No one will hire you
if you don't have some hidden skills.

39:35.105 --> 39:36.545
-Exactly.
-I can see

39:36.625 --> 39:38.265
that your hidden skills
just haven't been developed yet.

39:38.345 --> 39:39.305
-Is that so?
-That's right.

39:41.825 --> 39:42.665
How great.

39:43.265 --> 39:44.865
If luck can be ranked,

39:44.945 --> 39:47.105
my luck must be ranked first.

39:47.185 --> 39:49.465
No matter how hard my job is,

39:49.545 --> 39:50.745
I still have my friends to support me.

39:51.545 --> 39:52.865
I'm back to my energetic self again.

39:52.945 --> 39:54.385
You're a good student.

39:54.465 --> 39:55.345
Next meal's on you.

39:56.705 --> 39:58.585
No. I'm not paying.

39:58.665 --> 40:00.065
You'll never amount to much.

40:00.145 --> 40:01.265
Lei.

40:01.345 --> 40:03.065
-Next meal's on you.
-Don't look at me.

40:03.145 --> 40:04.425
It's still your treat.

40:04.505 --> 40:05.705
-Your treat?
-My treat?

40:05.785 --> 40:07.545
-Your treat.
-Mala crawfish.

40:17.985 --> 40:19.985
-The coffee machine is over there.
-Your office is looking posh.

40:24.665 --> 40:27.105
I finally realized what's wrong with this.

40:28.425 --> 40:30.945
This proposal lacks a concrete approach
to address the pain points.

40:31.745 --> 40:33.665
Didn't you ask me to amend it

40:33.745 --> 40:35.785
-to increase the value?
-That's right.

40:35.865 --> 40:38.465
This version is too conceptual.
It's too abstract.

40:38.545 --> 40:39.505
Do you understand?

40:40.345 --> 40:42.745
But our direction previously

40:42.825 --> 40:45.185
was focusing on Mulanshuo
and Taobao's collaboration

40:45.265 --> 40:46.985
to show the advantage

40:47.065 --> 40:48.745
of fast delivery, powered by
their extensive logistics networks.

40:48.825 --> 40:50.545
If we suddenly change to something else,

40:50.625 --> 40:53.145
won't it create confusion
about the project's focus?

40:53.225 --> 40:54.465
Moreover, the whole direction
is different.

40:54.545 --> 40:55.905
Are you teaching me how to do things?

40:57.465 --> 40:58.945
Regardless of the project's direction,

40:59.025 --> 41:02.465
we must improve it to make it perfect.

41:02.545 --> 41:03.945
Ask the creative division to come up
with a few drafts

41:04.025 --> 41:05.385
so we can compare them.

41:05.465 --> 41:07.305
You are a rookie. You might not know

41:07.385 --> 41:10.065
that creativity comes
from making amendments.

41:10.145 --> 41:11.625
Why don't I ask Luke's opinion?

41:11.705 --> 41:14.025
If you ask your boss about everything,
what's the point of having us?

41:14.105 --> 41:16.905
Besides, there'll never be a final draft
in a good proposal.

41:16.985 --> 41:18.225
It can always be amended
before it is shot.

41:18.305 --> 41:19.465
Flora.

41:20.305 --> 41:21.705
Go and ask Luke.

41:21.785 --> 41:23.545
Ask the decision maker.

41:24.505 --> 41:26.345
-Lumi, what's the meaning of this?
-I mean what I said.

41:28.785 --> 41:31.105
Luke approved
this project's creative idea.

41:31.185 --> 41:33.745
If he finds out how you waste his efforts,

41:33.825 --> 41:35.225
who do you think will be in trouble?

41:36.505 --> 41:37.385
A rookie?

41:38.105 --> 41:39.105
Haven't you been a rookie before?

41:39.905 --> 41:41.465
If you keep making amendments,

41:41.545 --> 41:44.705
can you take responsibility
for delaying the progress?

41:46.305 --> 41:48.785
Well, let me ask Luke.

41:48.865 --> 41:50.785
I'll take responsibility
if anything happens.

42:00.665 --> 42:03.065
-Come in.
-Luke.

42:07.585 --> 42:11.265
Luke. It's time for the execution phase
of the creative idea.

42:11.345 --> 42:12.905
There's a delay in the progress.

42:12.985 --> 42:13.905
There have been ongoing opinions.

42:13.985 --> 42:16.585
Didn't I approve the proposal?
Why are there so many opinions?

42:17.185 --> 42:18.865
That's not an issue.

42:18.945 --> 42:20.865
I'm just worried that our direction
is wrong.

42:21.665 --> 42:22.505
How many drafts have been made?

42:23.745 --> 42:24.585
Seven or eight drafts.

42:25.305 --> 42:26.865
Completing a project on schedule

42:26.945 --> 42:28.745
is also an important assessment criterion
for a PM.

42:29.305 --> 42:31.105
I know. It's my mistake.

42:31.185 --> 42:32.545
These are the revision comments.

42:32.625 --> 42:34.105
Do you want to take a look?
I'll follow up on the progress.

42:34.185 --> 42:35.025
No.

42:35.905 --> 42:37.105
Go back and create a work group.

42:37.185 --> 42:39.105
Anyone can raise their opinions
in the group.

42:39.185 --> 42:41.305
Every round of communication going forward
must be recorded in an email.

42:42.225 --> 42:45.265
Wouldn't it be too formal
to record every conversation in an email?

42:47.785 --> 42:48.825
Formal?

42:50.505 --> 42:51.785
Is the workplace some kind
of child's play?

42:52.425 --> 42:55.345
Having it in writing is what protects you.

42:57.385 --> 43:00.145
Got it. Can I add you to the group?

43:00.225 --> 43:01.505
You don't need to speak.

43:02.785 --> 43:05.625
Summarize the work discussed
in the group and send it via email.

43:05.705 --> 43:08.425
The email must be concise.
Highlight the important points in red.

43:08.505 --> 43:09.345
CC the related people.

43:09.945 --> 43:11.985
Got it. I'll do as you say.

43:14.265 --> 43:16.425
The golden rule of workplace communication

43:17.105 --> 43:18.625
is that whoever proposes
must take responsibility.

43:19.745 --> 43:22.225
The person with an opinion
must provide a solution.

43:23.425 --> 43:25.225
What if they just mention it casually?

43:26.425 --> 43:27.385
Get him to shut up, then.

43:27.465 --> 43:29.105
No need for nonsense in the workplace.

43:29.185 --> 43:30.065
You only need results.

43:31.225 --> 43:33.705
I got it. Thank you.
I've learned something else.

43:34.425 --> 43:35.585
Don't thank me just yet.

43:35.665 --> 43:38.025
Have you prepared yourself
for the commercial shoot?

43:39.465 --> 43:40.825
Can I really go there?

43:40.905 --> 43:42.425
Lumi recommended you.

43:43.225 --> 43:44.705
She specifically requested that you go.

43:44.785 --> 43:46.745
This time, the filming location
is in the mountains.

43:46.825 --> 43:47.665
The conditions are quite harsh.

43:47.745 --> 43:49.425
-Can you do it?
-I can.

43:49.505 --> 43:50.665
I don't mind the dirty work.

43:55.585 --> 43:57.265
Handling the dirty work
isn't something to brag about.

43:57.345 --> 43:58.305
You can do all the work,

43:58.385 --> 43:59.945
but without the result,
it still means nothing.

44:00.825 --> 44:02.345
-Because--
-Only results speak for you.

44:02.865 --> 44:03.825
I understand.

44:07.825 --> 44:09.265
I'll charge you a tuition fee next time.

44:11.665 --> 44:12.985
Goodbye, Luke.

44:17.385 --> 44:19.625
-Hello. Can I clean this room?
-Sure.

44:28.265 --> 44:29.625
What is this?

44:39.505 --> 44:40.865
It's probably from the typewriter.

44:40.945 --> 44:42.505
It's probably useless now.

44:42.585 --> 44:45.025
-No, it's not. Give it to me.
-Okay.

44:45.105 --> 44:46.105
Thanks, madam.

45:22.345 --> 45:24.985
How dare you wear my man's clothes?

45:27.145 --> 45:28.665
I… I did not.
